{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：10:16 2026-08-18 HKT</p>\n<p>筲箕灣阿公岩道25號明華大廈A座，今（18日）早上8時32分，一名男子疑由高處墮下，昏迷不醒。救援人員接報到場，將他救起及送往東區醫院，惜經搶救後證實不治。據悉，事主當時身穿郵差制服墮樓，相信任職郵差。</p>\n<img alt=\"現場地面遺下血迹，一對鞋及腰帶。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c94bf1d32697d042ed0c1863772af05/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_11_02_34_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有郵政人員到醫院協查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31fd575f85b564995cc1f402bb39c222/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_10_27_55.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d644f2f6fbdf4009e704dde1b5e3715/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_10_25_06_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到醫院調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b506929e03fb1fe8179212b1d7376c52/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_10_10_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8a30ca202e550453831ac9cf80a4751/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_10_10_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有郵政人員到醫院協助警方調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68e70ab91570aabba9efac663dac3591/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_10_08_51.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有郵政人員到醫院協助警方調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e01b0695e371ed6e78ebe11827a37bfe/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_10_08_50_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3be1c05ecd3cec4ff1fb0491d3c7ffd8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_10_08_50.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現場大廈正進行外牆維修，有棚架及圍網，地面遺下一灘血迹，並有一對皮鞋及腰帶。警方正調查事主墮樓原因。其後有郵政職員到醫院協助警員調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"墮樓現場仍有警員看守。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85c6f8dbc7fc39cfe30baf2bf2c14ed8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_11_02_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場搭了棚及圍網。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89d657a4fec31674b0ae6da11044438a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_11_02_33_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場地面遺下一對皮鞋。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63e4d76e9bee4cbf40e5fb3d5891a597/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_11_02_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fa696af29aeb313beb05f865c464620/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_11_02_32_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場搭了棚及圍網。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e1616e1014b8cbb9ac5427588c8c420/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-18_at_11_02_32_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T03:39:44.113761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}